    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output: Irrigation management and agriculture support services improved 
Indicator: Long-term performance-based lease contract signed for Muhuri Irrigation Project large-scale irrigation project. 
Achievement: Y 
Progress/Status: Achieved.
Based on assessment of performance of the 
construction phase-irrigation management 
operator (C-IMO), public-private partnership 
(PPP) long term lease contractor was not 
recommended by the Independent Panel of 
Experts (IPOE), engaged by ADB. IPOE 
reviewed the existing system and 
recommended establishing a M-IMO Board 
instead for long-term irrigation management 
system for Muhuri Irrigation Project. BWDB 
prepared the guideline for M-IMO constitution 
which was not convergence with IPOE&amp;apos;s 
proposal. Based on BWDB&amp;apos;s proposal, which 
was agreed by ADB, a leasing framework 
guideline has been prepared by BWDB to 
leasing out the schemes to WMOs gradually. 
The guideline was approved by MOWR by 
September 2024. The first batch schemes (112 
nos.) are signed on 31-Dec-2024. To date, a total of 
130 schemes have been leased out. 
Data Source: Signed lease agreement 
Baseline year: 2013 
Baseline value: Not applicable 
Baseline year: 2013 
Baseline value: Not applicable 
Target year: 2024 
Target value: Y 
Actual value: Y</narrative>
